      "ko": "그 고기와 가죽은 진 밖에서 불사르니라",
      "source_text_hash": "3a5e42254feaa3d6440ddb8533723cb2f3aaf4176090a12dbae2a28d0ae1d5ad",
      "translation_text_hash": "1f10fa4dbf66fc474cf99828f36ce1b7ecd282cae773c54792c68900bc9cc75c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
